PROTECT.ENG,compressed_security_text,1,,"There is a traitor among us.  We are questioning everyone, including YOU! Answer this question correctly and you will prove your loyalty to House Harkonnen!","There is a traitor among us.  We are questioning everyone, including YOU! Answer this question correctly and you will prove your loyalty to House Harkonnen!",,보안 질문 (편집 제외),공통,원문 유지
PROTECT.ENG,compressed_security_text,2,,"Correct, you are truly loyal to House Harkonnen!","Correct, you are truly loyal to House Harkonnen!",,보안 질문 (편집 제외),공통,원문 유지
PROTECT.ENG,compressed_security_text,3,,That is the wrong answer!,That is the wrong answer!,,보안 질문 (편집 제외),공통,원문 유지
PROTECT.ENG,compressed_security_text,4,,We have reports that you have been trading confidential information with the Ordos. You must answer a question correctly to prove your innocence.,We have reports that you have been trading confidential information with the Ordos. You must answer a question correctly to prove your innocence.,,보안 질문 (편집 제외),공통,원문 유지
PROTECT.ENG,compressed_security_text,5,,"Very good, I am glad to see that our reports were wrong about you.","Very good, I am glad to see that our reports were wrong about you.",,보안 질문 (편집 제외),공통,원문 유지
PROTECT.ENG,compressed_security_text,6,,That is incorrect!,That is incorrect!,,보안 질문 (편집 제외),공통,원문 유지
PROTECT.ENG,compressed_security_text,7,,"There is talk of an information leak within the ranks of the high military. To prove your innocence, you must answer the following question accurately:","There is talk of an information leak within the ranks of the high military. To prove your innocence, you must answer the following question accurately:",,보안 질문 (편집 제외),공통,원문 유지
